e our platform, in compliance with the Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) and applicable data protection laws."}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-normal text-text-primary mb-3","children":"2. Data We Collect"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"We collect the following categories of personal data:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Account information:"}]," ","name, email address, display name, and profile picture when you create an account."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Authentication data:"}]," ","passwords (stored as hashed values) and OAuth tokens when using third-party login providers (Google, Apple)."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Content data:"}]," ","virtual tour content you create, including splat files, thumbnails, scene metadata, waypoints, and hotspots."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Usage data:"}]," page views, tour views (anonymized via IP hashing), browser type, device information, and interaction patterns."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Billing data:"}]," ","payment information processed securely through Stripe. We do not store credit card numbers directly."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Communications:"}]," ","information you provide when contacting us through our contact form or support channels."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-normal text-text-primary mb-3","children":"3. Consent"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"By creating an account, you consent to the collection and processing of your personal data as described in this policy. You provide explicit consent during signup by accepting this privacy policy via the consent checkbox."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You may withdraw your consent at any time by deleting your account or contacting us at privacy@cloudtour.app. Withdrawal of consent does not affect the lawfulness of processing based on consent before its withdrawal."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-normal text-text-primary mb-3","children":"4. How We Use Your Data"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"We use your personal data for the following purposes:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"To provide, maintain, and improve our platform and services"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To authenticate your identity and manage your account"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To process payments and manage billing"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To send transactional emails (welcome, invitations, password resets)"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To enforce plan limits and usage quotas"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To analyze platform usage and improve user experience"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To respond to your inquiries and support requests"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To comply with legal obligations"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-normal text-text-primary mb-3","children":"5. Data Sharing"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with the following third parties, strictly as necessary to operate the platform:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Supabase:"}]," ","database hosting, authentication, and file storage."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Stripe:"}]," payment processing for subscriptions."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Resend:"}]," ","transactional email delivery."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-text-primary","children":"Vercel:"}]," ","application hosting and edge delivery."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Published tour content is publicly accessible by design. All other data is accessible only to authenticated organization members with appropriate roles."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-normal text-text-primary mb-3","children":"6. Data Retention"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, we will delete or anonymize your personal data within 30 days, except where we are required by law to retain certain information."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Tour content associated with deleted accounts will be permanently removed, including all splat files, thumbnails, and metadata stored in our systems."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-normal text-text-primary mb-3","children":"7. Your Rights"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary","children":[["$",